_pdf","qualificationId":"land_surveyor","year":2025,"section":"午前の部","questionId":"land_surveyor:2025:午前の部:9","questionNumber":9,"fieldId":"l1","unitId":null,"stem":"次の〔図〕の直線EFを平行移動させ、新たに直線ADとの交点をE’点、直線BCと\nの交点をF’点とした場合において、A点、B点、F’点、E’点及びA点を順次直線で結\nんだ区画の面積が50.00m2となるとき、B点からF’点までの距離として最も近いものは、\n後記1 から5 までのうち、どれか。\nただし、〔表〕は現地を観測した結果である。また、E点はA点とD点を結ぶ直線上の\n点、F点はB点とC点を結ぶ直線上の点であり、直線EFは直線ADと直交する。\n〔図〕\n〔表〕\n角度及び測距        測定値\n∠DAB               90°00′\n直線AB                10.00m\n直線AE                8.00m\n直線EF                8.00m\n直線AD                12.00m","stemMode":"text","choices":["5.358m","5.524m","5.533m","5.546m","5.550m"],"choiceMode":"text","correctAnswer":2,"diagramRequired":true,"figures":[{"kind":"official_pdf_crop","file":"land_surveyor-2025-4a90ae3875c1-q9-p12.png","page":12,"rect":[91.2,238.4,527.3,618.8],"zoom":3,"width":1309,"height":1142,"sha256":"40d99caa8846a60c7dfeda8956ea41e5857313038d6b8896ccc34f7044b82db9","svgFile":"land_surveyor-2025-4a90ae3875c1-q9-p12.svg","svgSha256":"a97c13ea93289185ac190a95f70d4bad572cc93ba56f872691323aec4391d660"}],"questionPdfUrl":"https://www.moj.go.jp/content/001450010.pdf","answerPdfUrl":"https://www.moj.go.jp/content/001450015.pdf","questionPdfSha256":"4a90ae3875c14c1eeda4b3ac9a32c6387b69b5cc15d0f5b62a99514af78267d0","answerPdfSha256":"3b6c2bbcb630b6ff6f989890f4e544e0eae7f8067fbefa86cad613fe5b659fad","evidence":{"questionPdfPages":[12],"questionRect":[59.23804473876953,748.6006469726562],"field":"official_exam_section","fieldEvidence":"午前の部","notes":["verified_pdf_text","official_diagrams_only"]},"verification":{"questionText":"runtime_pdf_checked","choices":"runtime_pdf_checked","answer":"same_year_official_answer_checked","visual":"official_pdf_crop_rendered","field":"verified"}},{"sourceMode":"runtime_official_pdf","qualificationId":"land_surveyor","year":2025,"section":"午前の部","questionId":"land_surveyor:2025:午前の部:10","questionNumber":10,"fieldId":"l1","unitId":null,"stem":"次の〔図〕のとおり、A、B、C及びAの各点を順次結んだ直線で区割りされた甲土地\nとA、D、E、C、B及びAの各点を順次結んだ直線で区割りされた乙土地について、\nこれらの土地の面積を変えずに交換するため、直線AD上にP点を設置し、直線CE上\nにQ点を設置して、直線PQで区割りした。区割りにより新たに甲′土地(A、P、Q、\nC及びAの各点を順次結んだ直線で区割りされた土地)と乙′土地(P、D、E、Q及び\nPの各点を順次結んだ直線で区割りされた土地)の区画に変更し、甲土地と甲′土地、乙\n土地と乙′土地の各面積がそれぞれ等しいものとする場合におけるCQの距離として最\nも近いものは、後記1 から5 までのうち、どれか。\nただし、〔表〕は現地を観測した結果である。また、直線ACと直線PQは平行であり、\n直線ADと直線CEは平行である。\n〔図〕\n甲土地\n乙土地\n〔表〕\n観測対象      角度         観測対象     水平距離\n∠ABC         74°25′        AB           38.60m\n∠BCE         40°00′        BC           55.30m\nAC           58.32m","stemMode":"text","choices":["17.63m","17.77m","17.92m","18.11m","18.30m"],"choiceMode":"text","correctAnswer":3,"diagramRequired":true,"figures":[{"kind":"official_pdf_crop","file":"land_surveyor-2025-4a90ae3875c1-q10-p13.png","page":13,"rect":[90.1,301.9,534.1,622],"zoom":3,"width":1333,"height":961,"sha256":"ffc4ecf2df037f00a4ae4c34ea6f46925447fad630b51d23e2179ed949488750","svgFile":"land_surveyor-2025-4a90ae3875c1-q10-p13.svg","svgSha256":"ef4c535cf9dd80a9a3ec0ae729be43eef170dcdaa6f600faea2eed83581f6555"}],"questionPdfUrl":"https://www.moj.go.jp/content/001450010.pdf","answerPdfUrl":"https://www.moj.go.jp/content/001450015.pdf","questionPdfSha256":"4a90ae3875c14c1eeda4b3ac9a32c6387b69b5cc15d0f5b62a99514af78267d0","answerPdfSha256":"3b6c2bbcb630b6ff6f989890f4e544e0eae7f8067fbefa86cad613fe5b659fad","evidence":{"questionPdfPages":[13],"questionRect":[59.22229766845703,748.6084594726562],"field":"official_exam_section","fieldEvidence":"午前の部","notes":["verified_pdf_text","official_diagrams_only"]},"verification":{"questionText":"runtime_pdf_checked","choices":"runtime_pdf_checked","answer":"same_year_official_answer_checked","visual":"official_pdf_crop_rendered","field":"verified"}}],"excluded":[]}}